{"3769120": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Final Stand", "steam_appid": 3769120, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Final Stand is a top-down shooting game that combines light Roguelite with construction elements. You can play as a soldier by yourself or with your friends, and use a variety of weapons and props to repel endless enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Main Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10+ gun arsenal: from shotguns to flamethrowers, pigeon + shooting, from scraping to invincibility, directly addictive!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >42 talent combinations: match different talents and weapons according to your preferences to unlock different surprise experiences!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >86 battlefield relics: defeat various ferocious monsters, choose the relics that suit you, and experience the instantly powerful feeling!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Support LAN connection: pick up guns, call friends, and blow up monsters together!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play at any time: 10-20 minutes a game, come to an exciting lunch break adventure at any time!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Final Stand is a top-down shooting game that combines light Roguelite with construction elements. You can play as a soldier by yourself or with your friends, and use a variety of weapons and props to repel endless enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Main Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10+ gun arsenal: from shotguns to flamethrowers, pigeon + shooting, from scraping to invincibility, directly addictive!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >42 talent combinations: match different talents and weapons according to your preferences to unlock different surprise experiences!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >86 battlefield relics: defeat various ferocious monsters, choose the relics that suit you, and experience the instantly powerful feeling!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Support LAN connection: pick up guns, call friends, and blow up monsters together!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play at any time: 10-20 minutes a game, come to an exciting lunch break adventure at any time!</p>", "short_description": "This is a top-down shooting game. You will fight alone or form a team to break through the apocalypse of monsters. By combining random weapons, talents and relics, you can create a unique fighting style and experience the thrill of counterattack from struggling to survive to mowing down enemies!", "supported_languages": "English, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Russian, Japanese, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Korean, Portuguese - Portugal", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769120/6c16f1da35d678c0c51bf61b580405d2d084fea6/header.jpg?t=1751213034", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769120/4ef8c2c9dc7cf848e00a611eea49ae2bb2bcbcb5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751213034", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769120/4ef8c2c9dc7cf848e00a611eea49ae2bb2bcbcb5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751213034", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64bit / Windows 11 64bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-8100 / AMD Ryzen 3 1200<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce G